ay alive.\n\nThe included expansion adds a supernatural strand in which the fallen rise, giving the squad three-way fights against living enemies and the undead. From the studios BirdIsland and PortaPlay, this single-player, story-driven tactics game has a grim tone and suits players who like squad management and narrative alongside careful tactical combat."}}